Problem Statement
An electric vehicle charging network tracks charging sessions across multiple stations. Each record contains session ID, station ID, city, charging date, energy consumed, charging duration, and payment status.
Your task is to build a Pandas-based analyzer that can create charging session data, clean invalid sessions, calculate station utilization, flag long charging sessions, identify high-energy stations, and generate city-wise revenue summaries.
